        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "3. Qualified employees losing time due to sickness, accident, or pregnancy shall be covered under the Health and Welfare and Pension program. The cost of maintaining these benefits shall be borne by the Employer for a period of up to six (6) months.",
